# Runtime dependencies of the pero-ocr inference path used by the adapter (PageParser with layout
# CNN, region sorters, line cropper and transformer/CTC OCR; PAGE XML and ALTO export). pero-ocr
# itself is installed from its pinned source archive with --no-deps (Dockerfile): its declared
# dependencies pin numpy~=1.24.2, which has no Python 3.12 wheels, and include training, language
# model decoding, music and PDF packages that inference does not import (README.md).
# numpy 1.x, the closest to pero-ocr's own numpy~=1.24.2 pin with Python 3.12 wheels, and the
# OpenCV 4 line (headless: the base has no libGL) that supports it.
numpy==1.26.4
scipy
opencv-python-headless<5
shapely
lxml
scikit-image
scikit-learn
numba
arabic-reshaper
